    "name": "Bloodmoon Rush",
    "steam_appid": 3360780,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360780/extras/44d43169077ffa6359ebdb19b2796128.avif?t=1749812422\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave through Dracula\u2019s castle to retrieve Davids true love; his car! In this 2D platformer with stunning visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it through 5 distinct areas of Dracula\u2019s castle, from the castle entrance to the intricate boiler floor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive enemies and defeat bosses of increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by retro games like Castlevania, and the wonderful vibes of 80s vaporwave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course talk with the chatty resident wizard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360780/extras/24cbb500781ccbac9e09c47b99d4f073.avif?t=1749812422\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360780/extras/44d43169077ffa6359ebdb19b2796128.avif?t=1749812422\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave through Dracula\u2019s castle to retrieve Davids true love; his car! In this 2D platformer with stunning visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it through 5 distinct areas of Dracula\u2019s castle, from the castle entrance to the intricate boiler floor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive enemies and defeat bosses of increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by retro games like Castlevania, and the wonderful vibes of 80s vaporwave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course talk with the chatty resident wizard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360780/extras/24cbb500781ccbac9e09c47b99d4f073.avif?t=1749812422\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Brave through Dracula\u2019s castle to retrieve Davids true love; his car! In this 2D platformer with stunning visuals, you\u2019ll face goons and ghouls, fight off Dracula\u2019s loyal staff and explore the castle on your way to the final boss, the big man himself.",
